This program contains detection rules ported from KoriyoSCAN
(https://github.com/reform-dev-team/exam-rf-guard),
Copyright 2026 KoriyoSCAN contributors, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The ported rules are in deskrx/core.py: the signal group key, the
same-access-point check, the empty-room counts, the watch decision, the
reception periods, the RSSI smoothing and the signal hints. They were
rewritten from Kotlin to Python and changed: the "acknowledged" list was
removed and a record of vanished signals was added.

This program is not part of KoriyoSCAN, and the KoriyoSCAN contributors do not
endorse it. Product and company names that appear in the code describe
